# T-1539 (extended): Old annotated payload constructor syntax [type [Node@[...] field: Type]]
# is rejected at parse time. The annotated VarRef in head position of an implied Call
# is now caught by is_old_payload_ctor (annotation: None restriction removed).
# The new form is: [type Node@[annotation]: [field: Type]].
[type [Node@[guarding: Bool] inner: NodeType]]
=== error
payload constructor syntax has changed: use `Node@["guarding": Bool]: [fields]` instead of `[Node@["guarding": Bool] fields]`
